    advanced: "Use buying to mislead opponents - buying a face-up card reveals information. Sometimes buying a card you don't need can confuse opponents about your hand direction. Calculate expected value of each purchase based on pot odds and probability of winning. In declaration, read opponents' betting patterns to determine if they're going high, low, or both.",
